      "content": "but what if life isn't meant to be 'carried'? what if some things are just meant to be final? i feel like i'm just dragging this toxicity around, making everyone else deal with the fallout of my existence. it feels less like 'healing' and more like pretending that a permanent stain isn't there. isn't there sometimes a point where you just admit that the only way to stop the damage is to just... stop? to just let it be over?",
